From: w1700k lan2 investigation
Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: airoha: add the missing break in airoha_pcs_an_restart()

The PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_USXGMII case falls through into "default: return".
Both paths leave the switch, so there is no functional change, but the
fallthrough is unannotated and reads as an accident rather than intent.

--- a/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
@@ -735,6 +735,7 @@
 		udelay(3);
 		regmap_clear_bits(maps->usxgmii_pcs, AIROHA_PCS_USXGMII_PCS_AN_CONTROL_0,
 				  AIROHA_PCS_USXGMII_AN_RESTART);
+		break;
 	default:
 		return;
 	}
